		Misc: {
			// AltarNeedsBait: The altar hungers for a royal offering...
			// KingCrabRageWarning: The tide churns — the King Crab will not let you leave his waters!
			KingCrabTitle: Король-краб
			KingCrabSubtitle: Владыка Прилива Теней
			// SealLocked1: The seal holds. The crown of the King Crab still rules this water.
			// SealLocked2: The seal holds. Nothing burns beyond the world yet.
			// SealLocked3: The seal holds. The jungle still keeps its bulb closed.
			// SealLocked4: The seal holds. The moon has not yet fallen.
			// SealOpened: The seal is spent. The way down is open.
			// SealBroken1: The first seal cracks — the tide gives up its deep.
			// SealBroken2: The second seal cracks — the trench draws breath.
			// SealBroken3: The third seal cracks — the pinch of the trench yields.
			// SealBroken4: The last seal cracks — the Heart of the Abyss lies open.
			SealCracked: Где-то в глубине по печати пошла трещина. Она ждёт, чтобы её открыли.
			// PressureDeath: "{0} was crushed by the weight of the deep"
			ShrineEmpty: Святилище тебе больше ничего не даст.
		}

